{"id": "EUVD-2026-103311", "enisaUuid": "218e2668-457a-3ce4-9486-f1154a841947", "description": "phpMyFAQ before 4.1.9 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the deleteUser() API that allows authenticated non-superadmin users with delete_user permission to delete superadmin accounts. Attackers can send a DELETE request to /admin/api/user/delete with a superadmin's userId other than 1, removing administrative access and accountability.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T11:42:56", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/thorsten/phpMyFAQ/security/advisories/GHSA-7j43-ww55-pm3g", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpmyfaq-before-4.1.9-missing-authorization-allows-superadmin-deletion-via-deleteuser-api"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111909", "GHSA-2jrh-wx9p-9fp9"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "60bd0485-c05b-33ef-a4d0-fcd5e9810f28", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.1.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "950a5dd5-d190-3222-b463-91238c661c2b", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}], "isExploited": false}